b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a> 的冯诺伊曼序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+,\\cdot\">\\(+,\\cdot\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" href=\"?note=5ec4763cfc7da9d5\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-addition\">18-df-ordinal-addition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" href=\"?note=c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-multiplication\">18-df-ordinal-multiplication</a> 的运算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 是极限序数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文件是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4a7ec48377bb048a\" href=\"?note=4a7ec48377bb048a\" title=\"18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega\">18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega</a> 的原编号重述入口；所有参数域与该节点相同，下式不引入另一套数学对象或证明关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(1+1)\\cdot\\omega=\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(1+1)\\cdot\\omega=\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原文件名以兼容已有入口，结论与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4a7ec48377bb048a\" href=\"?note=4a7ec48377bb048a\" title=\"18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega\">18-thm-finite-factor-times-omega</a> 一致。源页码和证明审阅状态沿用原记录；本轮没有新增原书页码核验或证明助理验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-additi